        "description": "Set a column value for an item. Use column_type to indicate the kind of column: 'status' for status/dropdown columns, 'date' for date columns (value: YYYY-MM-DD), 'number' for numeric columns, 'text' for text columns. Request body: Body: {board_id (required, string — board ID), column_id (required, string — column internal ID), value (required, string — new value; for status use the label text, for date use YYYY-MM-DD, for number use a numeric string), column_type (optional, string: 'status'|'date'|'number'|'text' — helps route to the correct update function)}.",
